      "notes": "Requires header x-schoolhub-secret. Body: { message_id, school_id, session_id, sender_name, sender_email, message }. Called by a Postgres trigger on chat_messages in the SchoolPro GH project (separate Supabase project) via pg_net - see supabase/migrations for the trigger definition in ghana-school-hub-main.",
