      "notes": "Writes directly into the SchoolPro GH project (separate Supabase project, kjfirgqhxhqernibsgvm) using its own service-role credentials. Only 2 retries, not 3 - a retried insert after a genuine partial failure risks a duplicate reply, worse than surfacing the error."
